The agent (Phase 4B PR B): a Nautobot Job, **Investigate an Event Ticket**, that reads one ticket, calls the read-only MCP tools an operator has enabled, and writes what it found back onto the ticket through the same service layer a human uses (rules A1-A10). `services/agent.py` holds the loop; `AgentRun` and `AgentToolCall` record what happened, and both are readable in the UI, the REST API and GraphQL. Plus an **Ollama** LLM provider type, reaching Ollama through its own API rather than its OpenAI-compatibility layer: that layer does not return tool calls in the `tool_calls` field, so an Ollama-backed agent on the OpenAI-compatible path could not call a tool at all.
